Subject: [PATCH] Sample: a tutor who moved to another unit this term

To run the night of 4 November 2026 again on the sample: HR's contract
T-26188, E-4417's casual contract to tutor HI101 in 2026 Semester 2,
moves to the unit PH101 on 28 September. HR keeps both versions, as it
keeps every version it records: the first, to HI101, until 28 September,
and the second, to PH101, from then on.

Only for the example (examples/night-in-test/): the project's sample
keeps one version of each contract.
